wam-wmcodecs: Windows Media audio decoders for WAM
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later

This library is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version; see LICENSE. It is built
only as a shared library (libwam-wmcodecs.dylib) so that applications under
other licenses link it dynamically and users can replace it.

WMA has no public specification. The bitstream layout, the Huffman, band and
LSP tables, and the reconstruction arithmetic come from FFmpeg's
reverse-engineered WMA decoder (libavcodec/wma.c, wmadec.c, wmadata.h,
aactab.c, wma_freqs.c; copyright (c) 2002 The FFmpeg Project and
contributors, LGPL-2.1-or-later). The tables in src/wma_tables.h are copied
from those files; the decoder in src/wma_decoder.cpp is a C++ rewrite of
their algorithm. FFmpeg: https://ffmpeg.org/
